{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>But for Adam he did not find a help</b> — Three times in the Masorah: ולאדם לא מצא עזר, ולאדם אמר כי שמעת לקול אשתך, ולאדם שלא עמל בו יתננו חלקו. ולאדם לא היה לו עזר — and HaShem did good for him and created the woman as a help, and he sinned through her; this is ולאדם אמר כי שמעת — he sinned by means of the help. Therefore ולאדם שלא עמל בו יתננו חלקו — death was decreed upon him."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The first two cited phrases are identifiable as Genesis 2:20 and 3:17; the third (ולאדם שלא עמל בו יתננו חלקו) does not correspond to any biblical verse and may be a non-scriptural tagline or possibly corrupt."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:34.662629464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}